          },
          "description": "Join Houndsley the dog and Catina the cat in three heartwarming stories that celebrate friendship, kindness, and slowing down to enjoy life’s little moments. In this gentle and charming collection, the two friends navigate big feelings, small mishaps, and meaningful discoveries—always with patience, humor, and care for each other.  \n\nIn Book 1, Catina dreams of being a famous writer and Houndsley wants to win a cooking contest, but both learn that true happiness comes from doing what you love—not chasing recognition. In Book 2, they’re each a little down about not knowing when to celebrate their birthdays, but find joy in inventing a day that’s perfect for them both. And in Book 3, a heavy snowfall cancels their plans. Houndsley embraces the peaceful quiet, while Catina learns that sometimes, slowing down can be just what you need.  \n\nFull of warmth, gentle humor, and timeless lessons, this collection is a cozy listen perfect for quiet time or any time.  \n\nThis collection includes:  \n\nBook 1: Houndsley and Catina  \nBook 2: Houndsley and Catina and the Birthday Surprise  \nBook 3: Houndsley and Catina and the Quiet Time",
          "author": "James Howe",
